    "heading": "7 Hardware/Compute",
    "paragraphs": [
     "Google Colab with a free-tier GPU (T4) for PINN training. Ground-truth generation (if not using the pre-computed Raissi dataset) will use scikit-fem/FEniCS, both light enough to run in Colab or locally."
    ]
